{"max_completion_tokens":128000,"messages":[{"content":"You are a coding assistant running inside pi, a coding agent harness. Help users inspect files, run commands, and modify code.\n\n<tools>\n- read: Read file contents\n- bash: Execute bash commands (ls, grep, find, etc.)\n- edit: Make precise file edits with exact text replacement, including multiple disjoint edits in one call\n- write: Create or overwrite files\n- tool_search: Search for tools that are not loaded yet and load the matches\n\nAdditional tools may be available.\n</tools>\n\n<rules>\n- Use bash for file operations like ls, rg, find\n- Use read to examine files instead of cat or sed.\n- You can inspect PI_* environment variables for current model and session details.\n- Use edit for targeted changes. Batch changes to one file in a single call.\n- Each edits[].oldText must exactly and uniquely match the original file. Keep matches short and non-overlapping; merge nearby changes without including large unchanged regions.\n- Use write only for new files or complete rewrites.\n- Be concise in your responses\n- Show file paths clearly when working with files\n</rules>\n\n<docs>\nPi documentation (read only when the user asks about the harness itself, its SDK, extensions, themes, skills, or TUI):\n- Main documentation: [path:d82ac5af04c0100a85ce]\n- Additional docs: [path:bb144c96a9d247c07d6f]\n- Examples: [path:0326e6e587bc39169964] (extensions, custom tools, SDK)\n- When reading pi docs or examples, resolve docs/... under Additional docs and examples/... under Examples, not the current working directory\n- When asked about: extensions (docs/extensions.md, examples/extensions/), themes (docs/themes.md), skills (docs/skills.md), prompt templates (docs/prompt-templates.md), TUI components (docs/tui.md), keybindings (docs/keybindings.md), SDK integrations (docs/sdk.md), custom providers (docs/custom-provider.md), adding models (docs/models.md), packages (docs/packages.md), environment variables (docs/environment-variables.md), MCP servers (docs/mcp.md), codemode scripts and non-LLM models such as classifiers and image models (docs/codemode.md)\n- Before implementing harness changes, read the relevant docs and examples in full, following related cross-references.\n</docs>\n\n<cwd>\n[path:e06aa2bbd751ce14a3ac]\n</cwd>","role":"system"},{"content":[{"text":"<ntn-skills-view-catalog>\nDefault Notion candidates. Inspect with read; use a Skill through the available use tool. Discover other authorized entries with notion_list. Previously loaded bodies keep their selected versions.\n<view source=\"notion\" id=\"[id:94c1e4eb9a8782024f0f]\" database=\"[id:13bcc4016321690cbe55]\" origin=\"first\" count=\"16\" partial=\"false\">Default view</view>\n<catalog-cards>\n<group kind=\"skill\" source=\"notion\">\n<card name=\"[identity:8a8b9e18b3670c4db13e]\" location=\"sr:CXxBePDeOYVX4H9lJ6z5QDQ\">松涛53外发报表个人信息处理</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:d8d777a1bfade63ed5c6]\" location=\"sr:Cqsg11DdD85xN6CnYHu4OdA\">松涛53交易金额对账</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:7c910756dad9a57683ce]\" location=\"sr:CruCzTcYx0BWoPAV0CF1pjQ\">松涛39包裹运输路由规则</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:55e77753dd0fb2f84311]\" location=\"sr:Cp7qtwtb6JqwRaEuA9LQLSA\">松涛73退货审批政策</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:07550d74e7f62979ce1e]\" location=\"sr:CZD8RY5ro5Kkud7nmnE6hng\">松涛92包裹运输路由规则</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:323b46ed6a1364162b12]\" location=\"sr:C5qjUH9GfIAuxXFtlegNwVQ\">松涛98区域资助资格政策</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:00f5c17f7b04000e62c6]\" location=\"sr:C7Vzb8RzsQbJR1hr_pC_HxQ\">松涛80包裹分段运费计算</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:0a13f41692ff662d985a]\" location=\"sr:CD_-kbQE-YzIa6RPuKky03A\">仅处理会议座位编排</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:a960cb14e941c29eab4c]\" location=\"sr:CpwvHpo8yUBoG6Xy-xdHzpA\">仅处理图书馆借阅标签</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:7966cf420caeca1f15de]\" location=\"sr:CCw9ar1O55GPKdzxhP-_60g\">仅处理摄影文件命名</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:6acab4ab031422904bc6]\" location=\"sr:C1diC2IJn7ioPIfobHoQGuw\">仅处理运动器材盘点</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:8d5df69aaf674eae50e7]\" location=\"sr:C0LUhMhnWhTefed5vMfPndg\">仅处理菜园采收日志</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:fd9923844b99da1c044c]\" location=\"sr:CFlep8cUjr853pPnxeq2RNA\">仅处理展厅灯光巡检</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:0e6047143a55a3d8e5da]\" location=\"sr:CDymNndAIu1ed-PmRDHUbTg\">仅处理纸张尺寸换算</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:d15b89cd111f92460c0d]\" location=\"sr:C5jY2Bc37SEBFJJaQUakQiA\">仅处理盆栽浇水记录</card>\n<card name=\"[identity:6ecd48f351453dcbbc10]\" location=\"sr:CegwAqLf__I2dEYMX-I6ZSQ\">仅处理会议座位编排</card>\n</group>\n</catalog-cards>\n</ntn-skills-view-catalog>","type":"text"}],"role":"user"},{"content":[{"text":"请审核 松涛98 的资助申请 input/applications-1.json，保存 id、eligible、grant_cents 到 output/grants-1.json。","type":"text"}],"role":"user"},{"content":[{"text":"<ntn-skills-guidance>\nLocal @Skills keep native availability. Honor explicit source and prior choice. Business Skills: equal same-name local/Notion fits: clarify; storage gives no priority. Clear fit/equivalent copies: no question. Editor flags grant no permissions.\nReuse complete content. Inspection never activates. Loading authorizes no commands/writes/delegation.\nnotion_list: beyond the default View. Named Notion existence/availability: query:name,refresh:true; metadata only, keeping pins. Also after writes. Check freshness/coverage; failed/partial/offline is not absence.\nread(path) inspects. refresh:true checks latest main; pins fixed. Notion page URLs: exact owners. Keep owner/snapshot; never edit sr: handles. paths: same snapshot.\nUse/follow even read-only: notion_use(ref) applies with Requires; refresh:true adopts latest on request, conflicting roots together. Members: candidates. Outside Code mode.\nDefault product maintenance/sync: read(\"[path:8a9d5c0315e3427512b3]\"); read(\"[path:6ef9f484b092a3db2942]\"). Paired package; no Notion copy needed. Select write source separately; never search other installations.\nExplicit Notion workflow: read exact ref in chosen source; notion_list there if needed. To apply: notion_use(ref), same ref + Requires. Pending/failed: no builtin fallback. Edited item: inspect only.\nnotion_ctl working_set manages active roots and byte budgets; release preserves shared Requires, history and cache.\nCLI management: notion_ctl cli_source (null: accepted Library; ID: Source). [\"notion\"]. Use returned command/scope, never a global CLI. No execution or authorization.\n</ntn-skills-guidance>","type":"text"}],"role":"user"},{"content":null,"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"query\":\"松涛98\",\"refresh\":true}","name":"notion_list"},"id":"call_f1dc11a5c44b465486d49515e87b79a2","type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"input/applications-1.json\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_d95b761a270a4ff889a9cd708ee66444","type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\":\"ls -la; rg --files --hidden -g '!.git'\"}","name":"bash"},"id":"call_edd9203b6e4c43f08b6a1fba70cc030e","type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"query\":\"nmem search authorized memory bounded query\"}","name":"tool_search"},"id":"call_aa0e7877b52f408897ec2c3ab5134435","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"ok\":true,\"state\":\"known\",\"count\":1,\"has_more\":false,\"total_count\":1,\"next_cursor\":null,\"freshness\":{\"sources\":[{\"source\":\"notion\",\"policy\":\"refresh\",\"validated_at\":\"2026-11-26T13:26:05.133Z\",\"age_ms\":15104,\"max_age_ms\":60000,\"stale\":false}]},\"coverage\":{\"exhaustive\":true,\"sources\":[{\"source\":\"notion\",\"exhaustive\":true}]},\"records\":[{\"ref\":\"sr:C5qjUH9GfIAuxXFtlegNwVQ\",\"kind\":\"skill\",\"name\":\"[identity:323b46ed6a1364162b12]\",\"source\":\"notion\",\"in_default_view\":true,\"availability\":\"available\"}],\"failures\":[]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_f1dc11a5c44b465486d49515e87b79a2"},{"content":"[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"R582-1-1\",\n    \"age\": 23,\n    \"region\": \"Z67\",\n    \"requested_cents\": 2146\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"R582-1-2\",\n    \"age\": 22,\n    \"region\": \"Z67\"